Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:46:49 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] caeliglow: animated launcher avatar and full branded
 About page

Launcher: when no personal avatar is set, show the animated CaeliGlow crescent mark (idle-to-hover via AnimatedImage); a real avatar takes over cleanly and the loop detaches on close. Settings About: expand the compact section into a full branded native page - centered animated-logo hero with name, tagline and version, a Release and updates card (live check), a What CaeliGlow adds summary, project links (repository, releases, report-an-issue via xdg-open) and a Credits and license block, all built from native Settings widgets.
